    h2 About This Example @40,255,671,21
    text This example section demonstrates a tabs widget that implements the . In this example, a tab is automatically activated and its associated panel is displayed when the tab receives focus. It is recommended that authors consider implementing automatic activation of tabs circumstances where panels can be displayed instantly, i.e., all panel content is present in the DOM. For additional guidance, see . @40,288,671,102
